  "answer_text": "IPsec sites: the default BFD timers are 1000 ms transmit, 1000 ms receive, with a multiplier of 5 (overall indicating ~5 seconds for detection after BFD is configured). Cloud Interconnect sites use 500 ms transmit, 500 ms receive, and a multiplier of 3. After you change BFD timers, re-establish the BFD session so the new values are negotiated with the remote peer; ensure BFD is enabled and configured on both the Cato Management Application and the remote peer, as timers are negotiated when the BFD session is established.",
